# Commits that only moved or renamed things. `git blame` should skip them and report the commit
# that last changed a line's *content*, not the one that relocated the file.
#
# Enable locally (once per clone; CI does not need it):
#     git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# Add a commit here only if it changed no behaviour — a pure move, rename or reformat. A commit
# that moved files *and* edited them belongs in neither category; split it instead.

